{"id":"n24653-1-10","stage":2,"title":"주고받다 · 交往 ","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n24653-1-10-1","ko":"너 지수랑 친하니?","zh":"你和智秀很熟吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"지수랑","meaning":"智秀","explanation":"지수：智秀；랑：连接共同参与或比较的对象，常表示“和、与”；结合句中动作理解。","readings":[{"term":"지수랑","audio":"/audio/3d2c488c84f071af04fd.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"친하니?","meaning":"亲近，要好，亲密","explanation":"친하다：亲近，要好，亲密；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"친하다","audio":"/audio/0275722d7b511a470593.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"80614","senseId":"1","lemma":"친하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"0275722d7b511a47","term":"친하다","zh":"亲近，要好，亲密","audio":"/audio/0275722d7b511a470593.mp3","entryId":"80614","definition":"近交相知，感情深厚。","pronunciation":["친하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/b3e7262bbf562aa5a67b.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n24653-1-10-2","ko":"아니, 가끔 안부나 주고받는 사이야.","zh":"不，只是偶尔互相问个好的关系而已。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아니,","meaning":"不，没","explanation":"아니：不，没","readings":[{"term":"아니","audio":"/audio/bcf26f704fdac00f644a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65980","senseId":"1","lemma":"아니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가끔","meaning":"偶尔，有时，时而，间或","explanation":"가끔：偶尔，有时，时而，间或","readings":[{"term":"가끔","audio":"/audio/712074afaec5737d4bcb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65204","senseId":"1","lemma":"가끔","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"안부나","meaning":"问候","explanation":"안부：问候；나：表示不止预期的数量、举例或退而求其次等，需结合整句语气。","readings":[{"term":"안부","audio":"/audio/5fd69abae96ae59b4e30.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16006","senseId":"1","lemma":"안부","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"주고받는","meaning":"交往 ，交换 ，授受","explanation":"주고받다：交往 ，交换 ，授受；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"주고받다","audio":"/audio/8d298d0cc09f70af9127.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24653","senseId":"1","lemma":"주고받다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사이야.","meaning":"关系","explanation":"사이：关系；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"사이","audio":"/audio/01aa8d172f6fe0b5d3b5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61187","senseId":"4","lemma":"사이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"bcf26f704fdac00f","term":"아니","zh":"不，没","audio":"/audio/bcf26f704fdac00f644a.mp3","entryId":"65980","definition":"用于表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["아니"]},{"id":"712074afaec5737d","term":"가끔","zh":"偶尔，有时，时而，间或","audio":"/audio/712074afaec5737d4bcb.mp3","entryId":"65204","definition":"不经常，偶然一次。","pronunciation":["가끔"]},{"id":"5fd69abae96ae59b","term":"안부","zh":"问候","audio":"/audio/5fd69abae96ae59b4e30.mp3","entryId":"16006","definition":"某人是否过得平安的消息；或指转达或询问那个来打招呼。","pronunciation":["안부"]},{"id":"8d298d0cc09f70af","term":"주고받다","zh":"交往 ，交换 ，授受","audio":"/audio/8d298d0cc09f70af9127.mp3","entryId":"24653","definition":"互相既给予又接受。","pronunciation":["주고받따"]},{"id":"01aa8d172f6fe0b5","term":"사이","zh":"关系","audio":"/audio/01aa8d172f6fe0b5d3b5.mp3","entryId":"61187","definition":"相互结交的关系或结交后亲密的程度。","pronunciation":["사이"]}],"audio":"/audio/b1aa00c7d3a8baf9ae34.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.55,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=24653","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":86,"sequenceScore":2.3767,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["你和智秀很熟吗？","不，只是偶尔互相问个好的关系而已。","怎么突然成为信徒了呀？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你和智秀很熟吗？","不，只是偶尔互相问个好的关系而已。","怎么突然成为信徒了呀？"],"answer":1}]}
